Text:  
For the metalworking industry, automotive, aerospace, and defense sectors, we are looking for a  

QUALITY CONTROL INSPECTOR  

The candidate will be responsible for:  

- Interpreting and understanding all the shape and position requirements of components: views, sections, both dimensional and geometric tolerances, surface finishes, etc.;  
- Using the main measuring instruments (calipers, micrometers, bore gauges, profilometers, altimeters, and similar);  
