Text:  
For a company located in Catania operating in civil and industrial plant engineering, specializing in the installation of photovoltaic systems, we are looking for a:

Marketing Specialist & Back Office Assistant

The sought-after figure will be responsible for defining and coordinating marketing activities and will collaborate in administrative activities.

